Changelog::kv
Selection having piercing sucks. We need a notion of z index maybe? Tokens eat each other as is.

---

Ok, so I just iterate backwards, which isn't exactly right.
So this is not a fixed bug, but it is not as urgent as it was.

Update
------

This was basically fixed. We z-sort based on type and are able to query for
the topmost one. I'll make a new bug if I want to change this behavior.
